<title>USA: IBS Financial Corp wins libel suit.</title>
<headline>IBS Financial Corp wins libel suit.</headline>
<dateline>CHERRY HILL, N.J. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBS Financial Corp said Tuesday its motion for summary judgment in the libel lawsuit filed against it by Lawrence B. Seidman has been granted.</p>
<p>The court, said the company, held that the statements about which Mr. Seidman complained were not actionable, and therefore dismissed the suit with prejudice.</p>
<p>IBS operates the Inter-Boro Savings and Loan Association, which has ten offices.</p>
